# Mechanic: Resolution pauses for a defender's Annihilator sacrifices.
# Forcing: Eight permanents require choosing six rather than an automatic sacrifice.
# AI behavior: Emrakul is the sole attacker against small creatures, with no spells available.
# Failure modes: Missing choice or unretired ability blocks progression to blockers.
# Card roles: Emrakul creates the trigger; six lands pay it; two creatures distinguish the retained cards.
# Protocol path: AbilityInstanceCreated, ResolutionStart, SelectNReq, sacrifices, ResolutionComplete, AbilityInstanceDeleted.
